<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>PharmacoWeave analysis report — {{ study_id }}</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; }
    body { margin: 2rem auto; max-width: 60rem; font: 16px/1.5 "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1c2834; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
    .banner { background: #e8f3f4; border-left: 4px solid #0f6f78; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
    th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid #d5dee5; text-align: left; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; vertical-align: top; }
    th { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #486070; }
    code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="banner">
    <strong>Research use only.</strong>
    Run <code>{{ run_id }}</code> calculated NCA and, when the fit was accepted, one-compartment IV bolus parameters.
    This is not a dosing recommendation, a medical-device output, or a regulatory report.
    Missing cells were omitted by a reporting rule or because a fit failed.
  </div>
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <p>Study <code>{{ study_id }}</code></p>
  <h2>NCA</h2>
  <p>Single-dose IV bolus, rich sampling, linear-up/log-down. BLQ samples stay censored. Times are in hours.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Subject</th><th>AUC last</th><th>AUC∞</th><th>Fraction</th><th>Cmax</th><th>Tmax (h)</th>
        <th>λz (1/h)</th><th>t½ (h)</th><th>Terminal</th><th>Notes</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in nca_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.subject_id }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.auc_last if row.auc_last is not none else "omitted" }} {{ row.auc_last_unit or "" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.auc_inf if row.auc_inf is not none else "omitted" }} {{ row.auc_inf_unit or "" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.auc_inf_extrap_fraction if row.auc_inf_extrap_fraction is not none else "omitted" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.cmax if row.cmax is not none else "omitted" }} {{ row.cmax_unit or "" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.tmax if row.tmax is not none else "omitted" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.lambda_z if row.lambda_z is not none else "omitted" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.half_life if row.half_life is not none else "omitted" }}</td>
        <td>{{ "qualified" if row.terminal_phase_qualified else "not qualified" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.excluded_reason or "" }} {% for note in row.warnings %}{{ note }} {% endfor %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>One-compartment IV bolus fit</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Fit</th><th>Status</th><th>Converged</th><th>Limitations</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for fit in fits %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ fit.fit_id }}</code></td>
        <td>{{ fit.diagnostic_status }}</td>
        <td>{{ fit.converged }}</td>
        <td>{% for item in fit.limitations %}{{ item }} {% endfor %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% if estimates %}
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Fit</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th><th>Unit</th><th>SE</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in estimates %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ item.fit_id }}</code></td>
        <td>{{ item.parameter }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.value }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.unit }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.standard_error if item.standard_error is not none else "" }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% else %}
  <p>No parameter estimates were written.</p>
  {% endif %}
  <h2>Not in this bundle</h2>
  <ul>
    {% for item in omitted %}
    <li><code>{{ item.role }}</code>: {{ item.reason }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <h2>Software</h2>
  <p>PharmacoWeave {{ version }}, schema {{ schema_version }}, written {{ generated_at }}.</p>
</body>
</html>
